INSERT INTO `chatbot_chatmessage` VALUES (1,'user','what is the fees for M V P COLLEGE OF\nPHYSIOTHERAPY, ADGAON,\nNASHIK this college','[]',0,NULL,'2026-05-29 07:38:58.776982','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(2,'assistant','According to the document, the fees for M V P COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY, ADGAON, NASHIK are:\n\nTuition Fee: 90,091\nDevelopment Fee: 9,909\nTotal Fee: 100,000','[\"MAHARASHTRA STATE BPT PRIVATE COLLEGES FEES.pdf\"]',0,'','2026-05-29 07:38:58.834281','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(3,'user','total fees for this college','[]',0,NULL,'2026-05-29 07:39:22.921035','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(4,'assistant','Unfortunately, I couldn\'t find the exact fees for M V P COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY, ADGAON, NASHIK in the provided documents.\n\nHowever, I found a document that seems to contain fees information for Maharashtra BPT colleges. According to that document:\n\n Fee Approved by Fees Regulating Authority, Maharashtra for Academic Year 2024-25\n\nBut I couldn\'t find the exact fees for M V P COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY, ADGAON, NASHIK.\n\nIf you provide more context or information, I may be able to help you better. \n\nTo calculate or extract fees you can use \n```python\n# assuming Tuition Fee, Development Fee and Total Fee are variables\ndef calculate_total_fees(Tuition_Fee, Development_Fee):\n    total_fees = Tuition_Fee + Development_Fee\n    return total_fees\n\nTuition_Fee = 90091 \nDevelopment_Fee = 9909 \n\ntotal_fees = calculate_total_fees(Tuition_Fee, Development_Fee)\nprint(\"The total fees are: \", total_fees)\n```','[\"MAHARASHTRA STATE BPT PRIVATE COLLEGES FEES.pdf\", \"SellList+R1-MBBS-BDS (2).pdf\"]',1,'The total fees are:  100000','2026-05-29 07:39:22.924359','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(5,'user','can you tell me inst id of AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF\nPHYSIOTHERAPY this college','[]',0,NULL,'2026-05-29 07:42:12.215595','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(6,'assistant','According to the document, I found:\n\nANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY \nNo | 44 | PT06372 | Aurangabad | PT | Upward | 70136 | 7364 | 77500\n\nThe INST ID seems to be PT06372. \n\nPlease let me know if you need more information. \n\nAlso, I couldn\'t find AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY directly; however, I found ANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY in Aurangabad. If it\'s the same college, then INST ID is PT06372. If not, please provide more information.','[\"MAHARASHTRA STATE BPT PRIVATE COLLEGES FEES.pdf\"]',0,'','2026-05-29 07:42:12.255718','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(7,'user','can you tell me inst id of AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY this college','[]',0,NULL,'2026-05-29 07:45:12.847974','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(8,'assistant','The INST ID for ANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY, AURANGABAD is PT06372.\n\nHowever, I couldn\'t find AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY directly.\n\nIf AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY and ANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY are the same, then INST ID is PT06372.\n\nIf not, I couldn\'t find the INST ID for AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY. \n\nPlease provide more information if needed.','[\"MAHARASHTRA STATE BPT PRIVATE COLLEGES FEES.pdf\"]',0,'','2026-05-29 07:45:13.021820','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(9,'user','can you tell me inst id of AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY this college','[]',0,NULL,'2026-05-29 07:49:39.301354','2a8e27376fdb4d17b41010b4ba0a5c69'),(10,'assistant','I couldn\'t find AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY directly in the provided documents.\n\nHowever, I found:\n\nANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY \nNo | 44 | PT06372 | Aurangabad | PT | Upward | 70136 | 7364 | 77500\n\nIf AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY and ANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY are the same or similar, then INST ID could be PT06372.\n\nIf AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY is a different college, I couldn\'t find its INST ID. \n\nPlease provide more information or confirm if AURANGABAD COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY and ANAND COLLEGE OF PHYSIOTHERAPY are the same.','[\"MAHA